      "claim": "No POL-RD-10 escalation trigger fires on this record. Every artifact that carries a deciding fact — EV-TRIP-00302, EV-GPS-00302 and EV-FARE-00302 — is COMPLETE with weight_multiplier 1.0, so under POL-GEN-02 the confidence cap does not drop below the 0.70 floor; the trip identifiers all match; pickup and dropoff timestamps on the admitted artifacts do not conflict by more than 10 minutes; the trace is not impaired; and no exculpatory clause has been invoked against a cited artifact. The only sub-1.0 artifact is the MISSING advisory, which is cited for its absence and carries no fact. The dispute is therefore capable of a monetary ruling and the rider's 12.30 refund should issue.",
